# The published WASM build images (ghcr.io/hazync/hazync-wasm-build), by digest: one line per image,
#   <tag> <sha256:digest>
# <tag> is reproduce/wasm-image-tag.sh's for (Rust toolchain, with C). .github/workflows/publish-wasm-image.yml builds,
# pushes and prints these lines; they are committed here after the package is public. The build scripts pull the image
# by this digest when its tag has a line, and build reproduce/wasm.Dockerfile locally (saying so) when it has none; a
# release refuses a locally built image (package-release.sh). Empty until the first publish.
